<h1>Whitespace &amp; escaping</h1>

{{! `~` trims whitespace on that side of the tag. }}
<p>Default (keeps newlines/indent):</p>
<ul>
  {{#each items}}
    <li>{{this}}</li>
  {{/each}}
</ul>

<p>Trimmed with <code>~</code> (compact):</p>
<ul>
  {{~#each items~}}
    <li>{{this}}</li>
  {{~/each~}}
</ul>

{{! A backslash escapes a mustache so it renders literally. }}
<p>Literal: \{{ this stays text }}.</p>

{{!-- A raw block ({{{{ }}}}) emits its body verbatim — mustaches inside
    are NOT evaluated. See the `raw` helper in helpers.js. --}}
<pre>{{{{raw}}}}
Hello {{name}} — this {{mustache}} is not evaluated.
{{{{/raw}}}}</pre>
